nded bloc united?</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Why North Korea's Kim Jong Un doesn't need a US deal</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:541e08d52ed93cd30537d56f9ccb56fb8ccf447120d0621c9f926d140bc7e1f7</id><updated>2026-09-11T12:54:23Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T10:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-north-korea-s-kim-jong-un-doesn-t-need-a-us-deal/a-79227854--e7f102464964.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-north-korea-s-kim-jong-un-doesn-t-need-a-us-deal/a-79227854?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump's overtures to North Korea's dictator have gone nowhere, with an emboldened Pyongyang accelerating its nuclear program and solidifying alliances with Russia and China.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>China angered by Taiwan VP's visit to EU democracy forum</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7e3bc3a2ee306234900890249e3709ab72a8db2de04a02e4caf2b2946434d8aa</id><updated>2026-09-11T12:54:33Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T10:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/china-angered-by-taiwan-vp-s-visit-to-eu-democracy-forum/a-79226311--51b6e60ff469.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/china-angered-by-taiwan-vp-s-visit-to-eu-democracy-forum/a-79226311?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Beijing has lodged a complaint with Italy and the EU over top Taiwanese officials visiting a democracy conference. The EU is navigating contentious issues with China and high-ranking Taiwanese visits are rare.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Hong Kong Tiananmen activists jailed for up to 7 years</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:03c22f21d6525c6e8a80f49ac56205266b705cf28b81d9294d5046c51bc35449</id><updated>2026-09-11T12:54:42Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T08:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/hong-kong-tiananmen-activists-jailed-for-up-to-7-years/a-79224243--b40cd2f6f0ea.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/hong-kong-tiananmen-activists-jailed-for-up-to-7-years/a-79224243?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Three pro-democracy activists who organized annual commemorations of China's deadly 1989 Tiananmen crackdown were charged under Hong Kong's Beijing-backed national security law.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Philippines ferry fire: Search continues for dozens missing</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6dbbe5d06cb1c5967ce64a802ba08598cee9dbe116112a656117ad6f2ffb6344</id><updated>2026-09-11T12:54:48Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T08:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/philippines-ferry-fire-search-continues-for-dozens-missing/a-79223425--fc38c9af4128.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/philippines-ferry-fire-search-continues-for-dozens-missing/a-79223425?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Firefighters searching for survivors combed through the smoking remains of a ferry off the coast of Coron island in the Philippines. Five people died and over 40 have been rescued</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>North Korea spends war windfall on arms, infrastructure</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c202513eaa74fbbd90e04409ccc512e81013b5aabcd71abb083d4c40d11ac328</id><updated>2026-09-11T12:53:47Z</updated><published>2026-09-10T14:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/north-korea-spends-war-windfall-on-arms-infrastructure/a-79218305--540623f7d851.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/north-korea-spends-war-windfall-on-arms-infrastructure/a-79218305?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Ukraine war and Pyongyang's alliance with Moscow have delivered an economic boost to North Korea, allowing the regime to pursue a range of long-desired projects.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Government proposes elected body for Ladakh</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d35fb48cc724517b4d3534055f6ef73f6de82b2fd89c8bdc5f50560203f2f6f8</id><updated>2026-09-11T12:53:47Z</updated><published>2026-09-10T13:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-government-proposes-elected-body-for-ladakh/live-79212708--848df6f2a45f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-government-proposes-elected-body-for-ladakh/live-79212708?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The government has suggested creating an elected Union Territory body. However, Ladakh leaders have expressed disappointment over the slow pace of progress. Follow DW for more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Myanmar seeks closer foreign ties amid global isolation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:15cf3cc29946cf7f41a3015312098b7c987f036eef3bdf7e75bcbb3e7821640b</id><updated>2026-09-11T12:53:47Z</updated><published>2026-09-10T12:09:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/myanmar-seeks-closer-foreign-ties-amid-global-isolation/a-79212234--8e8d12e76398.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/myanmar-seeks-closer-foreign-ties-amid-global-isolation/a-79212234?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Myanmar coup leader Min Aung Hlaing has been on a diplomatic offensive since becoming president in April, but foreign friends may still be few and far between.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>China: Cargo ship fire kills at least 25</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6ce643dbd1456cec52cd04a93eb0493bdb6be0b64a0a2aba809bf7bf177d405a</id><updated>2026-09-11T12:53:47Z</updated><published>2026-09-10T11:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/china-cargo-ship-fire-kills-at-lea